gamescope-session-steam — how to re-pin (no tags upstream: decisions/0012, register pass-flag)
  1. Read the commits since _commit on github.com/OpenGamingCollective/gamescope-session-steam
     (git log --stat <old>..main) and the diff of every file the package ships.
  2. Set _commit to the new sha; pkgver = r<git rev-list --count <sha>>.<short sha>.
  3. Re-check the [dram] changes in prepare()/package() still apply (each sed is
     followed by a grep that fails the build when it no longer matches).
  4. updpkgsums (git sources get a real b2sum of the checkout, never SKIP), then
     makepkg --printsrcinfo > .SRCINFO and update pkgs/manifest.txt.
